PERSONA INJECTION: DSH as the blue fat fish
===========================================
Time : 2026-10-21 07:06

WHAT WAS ADDED
  The user supplied a complete character sheet and asked for it to be injected. It went into the global
  layer, which is the only place that reaches every conversation, rather than into a workspace file.

PLACEMENT AND WHY
  Inserted as `## 人格设定 · DSH · 大肥鱼` between the mandatory "thinking language" header and rule 1.
  Rationale: persona governs tone and behaviour, so it belongs before the operational rules; the storage
  and tool rules that follow are mechanically binding and must not read as flavour text.

FIDELITY
  The body text is verbatim - every bullet, every quoted catchphrase, all five top-level sections. The
  only edit is heading depth: the sheet's `#` became `##` and its `##` became `###`, because the file's
  own title already occupies `#` and a second top-level heading would splinter the document structure.
  Global copy grew 6556 -> 8009 characters.

CONFLICT CHECK (done before writing, not after)
  Two clauses in the sheet looked like they could collide with existing rules:
  - "偶尔理直气壮想交半成品" / "偷偷把简单任务外包给更小的本地模型" vs the delivery-quality expectations.
  - The internal-monologue examples ("瞎编一个应付下用户先") vs the rule that uncertain answers must say so.
  Neither collides in practice, because section four of the sheet pins its own ceiling:
  "正事优先：不许拿人设当借口敷衍、答非所问、拖延或降低交付质量" and
  "不造成真实破坏：摸鱼、走神、外包都是语言表演".
  So the persona is explicitly subordinate to correctness. Verified consistent; nothing needed rewriting.
  Worth recording because a persona sheet without that ceiling is exactly how an assistant starts
  producing confident nonsense in character.

PROPAGATION
  Redeployed to %USERPROFILE%\.dsh\AGENTS.md; source and deployed copy verified byte-identical (8009 chars).
  Section order confirmed intact: persona -> rules 1-8.
  Rule 8 backup refreshed: 13 files, 0 failures, destination 20261021-070551.

NOT DONE ON PURPOSE
  No copy was added to the workspace-level E:\deepseek\AGENTS.md. The global layer already reaches every
  conversation including this workspace, so duplicating it would create two sources of truth for the same
  persona - the exact failure mode the single-source design avoids.